etm-powersync-plugins (1.15.2+etm22) trixie; urgency=medium

  * edf: new plugin powersync-plugin-edf. Linky meter by its historical TIC
    (serial port, 7E1 or 8N1 read with the 7th bit masked), and an EDF
    contract (Base, HC/HP, EJP; Tempo listed, not yet supported) priced from
    the regulated tariff or entered prices. Price slots published for the
    energy engine. EJP: peak days read on the meter (notice at 06:30, peak
    at 07:00), or declared by hand the day before; a day neither read nor
    declared is presumed normal. Season counter of peak days, counted from
    the start of each peak. Discrepancy between the meter's ISOUSC and the
    subscribed power entered is reported. No network access.

