etm-powersync-plugins (1.15.2+etm7) trixie; urgency=medium

  * openmeteo: back to a pure weather plugin. The PV plane ThingClass, the
    irradiance-to-power conversion, the pre-integrated energy windows and the
    ensemble spread are removed. They move to the ems experience plugin, which
    queries the Open-Meteo API itself and stores the forecast curve in its own
    database — which is what allows the forecast to be drawn against measured
    production, and what no scalar state could give.
