etm-powersync-plugins (1.15.2+etm3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * openmeteo: a PV plane can now actually be created. It was declared with
    createMethods "user", but Integrations.AddThing carries no parentId in the
    JSON-RPC protocol, so a plane could never learn which site it belongs to and
    resolveCoordinates would always fail. Planes are now discovered instead: one
    descriptor per configured site, each carrying the parent id, which nymea
    applies at creation. Found by pairing in testing, not by compiling.

